NEARS-1877 — the F1 "corrupt/truncated local cache row" path, observed LIVE and unprompted.

Not manufactured. On the first warm launch of the HEAD build (dd239138) on emulator-5560 the
config row left in cache_response_new_db.sqlite decoded as invalid JSON, so LocalClient.cachedFetch
threw straight out of jsonDecode. This is the exact path the [7a] F1 finding predicted and the one
the close-out certification calls "reachable only from a corrupt or truncated local cache row".

The fix classified it and rendered a retryable surface instead of a terminal spinner.

