Rendered result (a11y, light mode): "No internet connection" / "Oops!" / "Try Again"  -- i.e. the
classified failure surface with a working Retry, NOT a terminal spinner.

Retry recovery, same session: retryConfigFetch forces DataSourceEnum.client, bypassing the corrupt
local row. One tap recovered to the fully rendered home screen (modules, store rails, order card).

The log line is PII-safe: a const ApiFailure sentinel, endpoint path only, no payload, no exception
text on the [FAIL] line itself.
